What are the awesome SAM-powered products you want us to build? Drop your ideas in the comments! You can already use SAM 3 in the Instagram Edits app to apply effects to specific people or objects in your videos. SAM 3 and SAM 3D also power Facebook Marketplace’s View in Room feature, helping people visualize the style and fit of home decor items, like a lamp or a table, in their spaces before purchasing.

We would love to hear more ideas for what you want to see in our products.

@ludwigABAP: "What’s the catch with SAM models from Meta that no one seems to be using them to build the obvious awesome products one could build on top of them? I don’t get it."

Cool to see SAM continue to be referenced as vision's GPT moment, and a huge shout out to @roboflow for their amazing work in integrating SAM deeply across their entire platform and enabling access for many use cases from hobbyists to life scientists to enterprises and more.

@Mervenoyann: "I'm so rooting for @roboflow. SAM was GPT moment for vision, and they did God's work to get it to everyone."

We (with @xenovacom) had a tour by @josephofiowa in their small data center today.

